# UI component

## When to use
- New shared component under `app/components/` or `app/components/ui/`
- Refactor repeated panel chrome (headers, badges, tables)

## Inspect first
- `app/components/ui/Card.tsx` and similar primitives
- `frontend/lib/utils.ts` (`cn` helper)
- `app/globals.css` for design tokens
- Parent section for spacing and typography patterns

## Steps
1. Define explicit props interface (no `any`).
2. Use `cn()` for optional `className` merging.
3. Keep components stateless when possible; lift data to section or context.
4. Ensure keyboard/focus for interactive controls; use semantic HTML.
5. Support dark theme via existing CSS variables / ThemeProvider.

## Verification
- [ ] Renders in at least one section without layout shift
- [ ] Responsive at `sm` / `lg` breakpoints used on dashboard
- [ ] No direct `fetch` or trading rules inside UI component
